          "text": "Care while you work second shift"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000u2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000u3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Second shift is hard on families when child care closes as your shift starts. We stay open "
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000u4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "until 11 pm, Monday to Saturday"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k000u5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", so your child can be with people they know while you work."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000u6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000u7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A real evening routine"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000u8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000u9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Dinner is at 6 pm. Children go outside when the weather allows, school-age kids get homework help if they need it, and then everyone settles into calm activities like books, puzzles and quiet games. There is an evening snack at 9 pm. We keep the evening low-key so children are ready for bed when you pick them up."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000ua",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000ub",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What's for dinner"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000uc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000ud",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Dinner is at 6 pm through the USDA Child and Adult Care Food Program (CACFP). Like every meal we serve, it follows the program's standards: a protein, a whole grain, vegetables or fruit, and milk. Tell us about allergies or special diets when you enroll."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k000ue",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "k000uf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Safe pickup at night"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
